((-x)^{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡({x}^{3}) \\\\  & =-f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡({x}^{3})$ is an odd function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\sqrt[3]{\\pi }}^{\\sqrt[3]{\\pi }}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328399 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328400 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328401 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328402 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328403 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1041 "selection" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328403 13194139535042 true] [17592186328398 1110 #uuid "38e291dc-eede-5cbe-8cb1-556d4ae6ff7e" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328399 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{\\pi }}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328399 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328399 1111 #uuid "cabc1eeb-9608-5e71-8f52-686ab9f527d3" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328400 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{\\pi }}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328400 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328400 1111 #uuid "dfd634da-f8ce-502c-8146-c98df7aedab9" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328401 1034 "-2{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{\\pi }}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328401 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328401 1111 #uuid "a91ce62d-50ff-5e6b-8bd4-db84f4c3ee69" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328402 1034 "2{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{\\pi }}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328402 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328402 1111 #uuid "cef42c49-bc5b-55eb-9d95-09