 1034 "0" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328406 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328406 1111 #uuid "948a1765-e57e-539c-b9c8-bd22885976bb" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328407 1017 #edb/ref 17592186328408 13194139535042 true] [17592186328407 1089 "q-334381" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328407 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535042 true] [17592186328407 1100 "Given that ${\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x=p,$ express the value of ${\\int }_{-4}^{0}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x$ in terms of $p.$\n\n${\\int }_{-4}^{0}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328407 1113 #uuid "907a64cf-d571-5ede-8004-0a234be6fa30" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328407 1145 "Recall the following:\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *even* if $f(-x)=f(x),$\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *odd* if $f(-x)=-f(x).$\n\nMoreover, for any odd function $f(x),$ the graph of $y=f(x)$ has rotational symmetry of order $2$ about the origin, so we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$\n\nNotice that $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}$ is an odd function. Indeed, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-x) & =\\frac{(-x)^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{-\\sqrt[3]{x}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}} \\\\  & =-f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}$ is an odd function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-4}^{4}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$\n\nFinally, using the adjacent intervals rule for integration, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-4}^{4}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x & =0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-4}^{0}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x & =0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-4}^{0}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x+p & =0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-4}^{0}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\,\\text{d}x & =-p.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328408 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328409 13194139535042 true] [17592186328408 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328410 13194139535042 true] [17592186328408 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535042 true] [17592186328408 1041 "field-1" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328408 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328409 13194139535042 true] [17592186328408 1110 #uuid "b7e73c3f-5c06-58e2-a94c-ab85fa9d40c3" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328409 1034 "-p" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328409 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328409 1111 #uuid "a6186ac9-724b-59a8-912b-e8ec517e99ad" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328410 1034 "p" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328410 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328410 1111 #uuid "83671361-543b-593a-a3be-530324db12af" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328411 1017 #edb/ref 17592186328412 13194139535042 true] [17592186328411 1089 "q-334383" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328411 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535042 true] [17592186328411 1100 "Given that ${\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x=p,$ express the value of ${\\int }_{-2}^{0}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x$ in terms of $p.$\n\n${\\int }_{-2}^{0}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328411 1113 #uuid "ef396766-744f-533f-88e7-0870256ee4de" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328411 1145 "Recall the following:\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *even* if $f(-x)=f(x),$\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *odd* if $f(-x)=-f(x).$\n\nMoreover, for any odd function $f(x),$ the graph of $y=f(x)$ has rotational symmetry of order $2$ about the origin, so we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$\n\nNotice that $f(x)={e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)$ is an odd function. Indeed, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-x) & ={e}^{|-x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x) \\\\  & ={e}^{|x|}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)) \\\\  & =-{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x) \\\\  & =-f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)={e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)$ is an odd function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-2}^{2}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$\n\nFinally, using the adjacent intervals rule for integration, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-2}^{2}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-2}^{0}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-2}^{0}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x+p & =0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-2}^{0}{e}^{|x|}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-p.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328412 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328413 13194139535042 true] [17592186328412 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535042 true] [17592186328412 1041 "field-1" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328412 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328413 13194139535042 true] [17592186328412 1110 #uuid "660520c4-7d1d-5338-b9fb-7abc302d1ec1" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328413 1034 "-p" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328413 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328413 1111 #uuid "a7464299-3744-5439-850f-0f4d15492951" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328414 1017 #edb/ref 17592186328415 13194139535042 true] [17592186328414 1089 "q-88586" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328414 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535042 true] [17592186328414 1100 "${\\int }_{-5}^{5}{x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328414 1113 #uuid "8d29353e-115f-52b4-80fa-b9c7fdd3563f" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328414 1145 "Recall the following:\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *even* if $f(-x)=f(x)$\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *odd* if $f(-x)=-f(x)$\n\nMoreover, for any even function $f(x),$ the graph of $y=f(x)$ is symmetric across the $y$-axis, so we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNotice that $f(x)={x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}$ is an even function. Indeed, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-x) & =(-x)^{4}\\,{e}^{(-x)^{2}} \\\\  & ={x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)={x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}$ is an even function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-5}^{5}{x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{5}{x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328416 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328417 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328418 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328419 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328420 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1041 "selection" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328419 13194139535042 true] [17592186328415 1110 #uuid "69711ccb-86da-5dd0-b54c-611b81d4e05e" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328416 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{10}{x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328416 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328416 1111 #uuid "d074f739-fbb3-5d0d-a6b6-adbb55826957" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328417 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{10}{x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328417 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328417 1111 #uuid "b35badc9-cc23-5c66-9272-b4414dcf6b27" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328418 1034 "-{\\int }_{0}^{5}{x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328418 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328418 1111 #uuid "3fbc2d0b-2152-5282-966e-613708b259ff" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328419 1034 "2{\\int }_{0}^{5}{x}^{4}\\,{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328419 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true] [17592186328419 1111 #uuid "65df433c-f9c4-5d0d-9dba-a073e32a8e83" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328420 1034 "0" 13194139535042 true] [17592186328420 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535042 true